    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "2d55a2a6-617b-4860-ade2-1e666219f90d",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "b99a9575-dfe3-43f4-b849-7eb1654d1496",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* Cardiff hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "6ce9ae95-eec7-4fb6-8ac7-c8dee30a6434",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the centrally located 4* Radisson Blu Hotel in Cardiff. Located opposite Cardiff Castle, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant and bar and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "2a35a213-0110-4bbc-9e16-c13680265946",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELacock Village\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Cardiff\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECardiff Bay Visitor Centre\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWales Millennium Centre - behind the scenes tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECardiff Castle - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt Fagans National Museum of History Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastell Coch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENational Museum \u0026amp; Art Gallery of Wales\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFloors Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "7db37982-3461-4008-9e46-5c15f46e425a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENational Botanic Garden of Wales - created within a beautiful 568 acre Regency park combining 200 year old historical features with modern architecture and landscaping\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELlandaff Cathedral - dating back to 1107, the mainly Gothic cathedral stands on one of the oldest Christian sites in Britain\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECaerleon Roman Baths, Newport - the most varied Roman site in Britain, the complex is home to a fortress and baths, a well preserved amphitheatre and a row of barrack blocks\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlaenavon \u0026amp; Big Pit National Coal Museum - a multimedia presentation focuses on the modern coal mine, whilst an underground tour with a former miner depicts what life was ike for the thousands of men who worked at the coal face\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWye Valley - a scenic drive through the Wye Valley takes in the remains of Tintern Abbey, the best preserved abbey in Wales where Turner sketched andWordsworth drew inspiration\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "126070df-2b84-4db0-a47b-c3c90c7a3cc1",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Lacock Abbey\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 stop at a convenient property en route such as Lacock Abbey near Chippenham, a fine abbey founded in 1232 many parts of which have survived largely intact while the Victorian woodland garden includes an 18th century summer house and rose garden \u2013 continue to the centrally located 4* Radisson Blu Hotel in Cardiff.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Cardiff city tour, Cardiff Bay Visitor Centre \u0026amp; Wales Millennium Centre\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur guided tour of Cardiff includes a visit to the Senedd, the National Assembly Building, the exterior of the Norwegian Sailor\u2019s Church, established in 1868 to provide religious and social care to thousands of Norwegian sailors that were employed in the Norwegian merchant fleet, and the Cardiff Bay Visitor Centre \u2013 a behind the scenes tour of the Wales Millennium Centre discovers the 2004 building that is home to the national orchestra and opera, dance and theatre companies.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Cardiff Castle \u0026amp; St Fagans National Museum of History\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETour with our Blue Badge guide of Cardiff Castle exploring a history spanning nearly 2,000 years and introducing us to the lavish interiors created by William Burges for the 3rd Marquess of Bute \u2013 St Fagans National Museum of History, the 2019 Art Fund Museum of the Year, is set in 100 acres of parkland with over forty original buildings and a guided tour explores how the people of Wales have lived, worked and spent their leisure time over the last 500 years.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Castell Coch \u0026amp; National Museum Cardiff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECastell Coch, meaning Red Castle in Welsh, seems to be the perfect medieval fairytale castle but the interior is pure Victorian fantasy \u2013 time to wander through a wonderful collection at the National Museum Cardiff including one of the best collections of Impressionist works outside Paris.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Tredegar House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESet in a beautiful 90 acre park, Tredegar House is one of the best examples of a 17th century Charles II mansion in Britain, the earliest surviving part of which dates back to the early 1500\u2019s \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
